    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just so quiet now. like, i used to wake up and my whole body was just... ready. every muscle had a purpose. now i just wake up and i'm stuck in this body that doesn't even feel like mine anymore. it feels like the person who actually lived is just gone, and i'm just the leftover parts.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
