    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "letting go of the performance... i don't know. the problem is there's no performance left to do. the career is dead, the mobility is dead, even the way i move is different. it feels like i'm just watching a movie of someone else's life from the back of a dark theater. there's no point in trying to find a new version of me when that version is the only one that ever mattered.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
