      "content": "it feels like that. like even the silence is getting too loud. everyone keeps telling me to find a \"new passion\" or \"rebuild,\" but it just feels like they're asking me to build a house on a grave. how do you even move forward when the person who was supposed to live the rest of the life is already gone?",
